{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le10ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How's my wholesome Peter? If only you weren't so wholesome.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Good. Maybe a tad tipsy.  I think I have to go home. I have to finish this and then I'll be heading for the door.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter, you don't have to drink it.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: In a minute, I'll have finished this glass of wine and then I'll be grabbing a taxi.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Listen, at midnight, I will have shut down the bar, cleaned the kitchen and counted all the money. I could give you a ride then.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's ok. I'll take a cab.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If only we weren't so busy.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I didn't need a ride home, but that's ok. I have plenty of money.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes you do Mr. big shot.\n</br>(Vanessa leaves)", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le10ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What a comedy of errors.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Hey stranger! Drowning your sorrows or just taking them for a swim?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish they would drown ... Amy! Wow! How are you?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Great! I was just finishing dinner with some clients and I was just about to leave, so I thought I'd come over and say hello.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How is the job?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Really busy. The last time we spoke, I was just about to start studying again.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You didn't mention that.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Really? I have to be certified in order to be a life coach and then the board told me I must also get this other certificate, so I went overboard and tried to get them both.\nI didn't tell you? Sorry, I wish I had told you that.", "id": 2, "time": "40200", "image": "engenn10le10ob11re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's ok. Are you finished now?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: If only I were finished. I'm doing some other work online, I'll be doing it for a little while longer, but by next summer I will have finished.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Cool.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Listen Peter. You ought to give me your phone number. On second thought, you don't have to, here's my card. We should go out again, ok? I have got to run. Call me.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Looks like tomorrow, I'll be smiling ear to ear after all.", "id": 3, "time": "81000", "image": "engenn10le10ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le10ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le10ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about what I will have been doing and what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hopes and wishes and regrets.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express what is and isn't necessary.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " If you could go on a date with anyone in the world, who would it be with? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What famous person would you<span class=\"strong\"> not</span> want to date? Why?", "type": "Fre